{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37620","headline":"投时相十韵 · 郑谷","name":"投时相十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何以保孤危，操修自不知。\n衆中常杜口，梦里亦吟诗。\n失计辞山早，非才得仕迟。\n薄冰安可履，暗室岂能欺。\n勤苦流萤信，吁嗟宿燕知。\n残钟残漏晓，落叶落花时。\n故旧寒门少，文章外族衰。\n此生多轗轲，半世足漂离。\n省署随清品，渔舟爽素期。\n恋恩休未遂，双鬓渐成丝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37620.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37620","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}